    "scenesThatPass": [
      "ELEANOR: I’m so sorry I was sick. I should have been there for you. I’m so grateful you’re alive. I think I would have died - or just killed myself. …\nCELESTE: Oh, God, Ellie. I think I’ve done something terrible.\nELEANOR: It’s not your fault. What more could you have done? You’re safe with me.",
      "CELESTE: I don’t want anyone to see me like this.\nELEANOR: You look fine.\nCELESTE: Can you talk to them?\nELEANOR: Me? What am I supposed to say? I wasn’t there.",
      "ELEANOR: Yes, the hotel’s very nice.\nCELESTE: Yes, it’s great. So, what’s next?",
      "CELESTE: I like it.\nELEANOR: I like it too.",
      "CHOREOGRAPHER: Keep your abdominal muscles as stiff as you can.\nCHOREOGRAPHER: Okay, almost, and again.\nCHOREOGRAPHER: Better. Try again.\nCHOREOGRAPHER: Are you all right? We can take a break."
    ]
